    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stopping for a moment doesn't really help though. i stop for a second and the treadmill just keeps pulling me. it's not even about needing a break anymore, it's more like... there's no point in ever being \"rested\" enough to handle this. it feels like the only way to actually get some peace is to just not be in the race at all.",
